  "A: Your CSAT marks don't count in the merit list. | B: But fail it, and your GS score is never even checked.",
  [ST("The paper", [(80, "", "questions", "80"), (200, "", "marks, 2 hours", "200")],
      "A: It has 80 questions | B: for 200 marks, in two hours."),
   ST("The bar", [(33, "%", "to qualify: 66 of 200", "33")],
      "A: You need 33 percent. | B: That's 66 marks out of 200."),
   TL("Why it changed", [(2011, "CSAT introduced", "2011"), (2015, "Made qualifying", "2015")],
      "A: CSAT came in 2011, and counted towards the cutoff. | B: From 2015, it became qualifying only.")],
